ta#{2}":[380,380],"#Using Performance Analytics with external data#Limitations when using Performance Analytics with external data#{3}":[381,381],"#Using Performance Analytics with external data#Limitations when using Performance Analytics with external data#{4}":[382,382],"#Using Performance Analytics with external data#Limitations when using Performance Analytics with external data#{5}":[383,383],"#Using Performance Analytics with external data#Limitations when using Performance Analytics with external data#{6}":[384,385],"#Using Performance Analytics with external data#Related":[386,396],"#Using Performance Analytics with external data#Related#{1}":[388,388],"#Using Performance Analytics with external data#Related#{2}":[389,389],"#Using Performance Analytics with external data#Related#{3}":[390,390],"#Using Performance Analytics with external data#Related#{4}":[391,391],"#Using Performance Analytics with external data#Related#{5}":[392,392],"#Using Performance Analytics with external data#Related#{6}":[393,393],"#Using Performance Analytics with external data#Related#{7}":[394,394],"#Using Performance Analytics with external data#Related#{8}":[395,396]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Configure Performance Analytics advanced features","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/performance-analytics/c_PADataArchitecture.md","line":36},{"title":"JDBC type data source","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/integrate-applications/r_JDBCTypeDataSource.md","line":41},{"title":"JDBC type data source","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/integrate-applications/r_JDBCTypeDataSource.md","line":56},{"title":"Platform Analytics","target":"c_performanceAnalyticsAndReporting","line":68},{"title":"Analytics Hub","target":"c_UsePerformanceAnalyticsScorecards","line":118},{"title":"Platform Analytics experience","target":"par-workspace","line":118},{"title":"Indicator scores in reference currency","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/performance-analytics/indicator-scores-reference-currency.md","line":126},{"title":"Exclude time series from an indicator","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/performance-analytics/c_ExcludingTimeSeriesFromIndicators.md","line":128},{"title":"Rounding and precision in indicators","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/performance-analytics/r_FormulaRounding.md","line":138},{"title":"Rounding and precision in indicators","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/performance-analytics/r_FormulaRounding.md","line":146},{"title":"Access control","target":"access-control","line":149},{"title":"KPI Details","target":"kpi-details","line":154},{"title":"Applying time series aggregations","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/performance-analytics/applying-time-series-aggregations.md","line":174},{"title":"Real-time scores","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/performance-analytics/real-time-scores.md","line":222},{"title":"real-time scores","target":"real-time-scores","line":224},{"title":"widgets","target":"widgets","line":229},{"title":"Analytics Hub list of indicators","target":"c_UseIndicatorOverview","line":231},{"title":"Performance Analytics scores forecasts","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/performance-analytics/c_ForecastingData.md","line":239},{"title":"JDBC type data source","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/integrate-applications/r_JDBCTypeDataSource.md","line":255},{"title":"breakdown elements","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/performance-analytics/performance-analytics-glossary.md","line":277},{"title":"Platform Analytics","target":"c_performanceAnalyticsAndReporting","line":388},{"title":"Analytics Hub","target":"c_UsePerformanceAnalyticsScorecards","line":389},{"title":"Platform Analytics experience","target":"par-workspace","line":390},{"title":"Access control","target":"access-control","line":391},{"title":"KPI Details","target":"kpi-details","line":392},{"title":"Real-time scores","target":"real-time-scores","line":393},{"title":"Widgets","target":"widgets","line":394},{"title":"Analytics Hub list of indicators","target":"c_UseIndicatorOverview","line":395}],"metadata":{"title":"Using Performance Analytics with external data","description":"Performance Analytics on external data sources enables you to perform detailed analysis on data that is not in your ServiceNow instance.Performance Analytics supports only the database formats that ServiceNow supports by default. If a customer adds a JDBC driver for an unsupported database format, Performance Analytics does not support that database format as an external data source.Create an external indicator to define what data to evaluate and the SQL statement used to determine the indicator score.Create an external breakdown to define what elements are available to break down external indicator scores.Associate an external indicator and external breakdown to define how to collect breakdown scores for the indicator.Test your external indicators and breakdowns to ensure that you can connect to the external data source and collect the data you expect.When using Performance Analytics with external data you must filter SQL statements that collect scores by date.Certain Performance Analytics functionality is not available when you measure external data.","locale":"en-US","cano